# Lumen Shelf (CIPlay lumen_shelf): the spar's foot, the survey notes, the spar platform chest (air in the spar on the
# way), lamp 3 and its air, the three anglers, the survey hut, the sled box, the edge's air under the arch, the mess
# chest, the last survey note.
island Lumen Shelf
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Glowing Shelf
zone spar_foot
expect step 1
read Survey line notes
expect step 2
air spar_air1
air spar_air2
open Spar platform chest
wait 3
expect step 3
zone lamp_3
air lamp_3
expect step 4
kill Angler fish
expect step 5
open Survey hut chest
wait 3
expect step 6
open Survey sled box
wait 3
expect step 7
zone edge
air edge
expect step 8
open Mess chest
wait 3
expect step 9
zone lu_ridge
expect step 10
zone lu_cave
expect step 11
read Surveyor's hut note
expect step 12
read Caravan logbook
expect step 13
read Last survey note
expect done
